 keycard sandbox   setup · step 6 of 6

  Save
  Saved settings come back the next time you start the sandbox. Without
  saving, setup asks for them again next time.

  Save these settings for next time?
  Yes saves them in ~/.config/keycard/sandbox.yaml, and the secrets you typed
  in the macOS keychain. No keeps them until you quit.

    Yes     No
  y or n answers it.









  ←→  choose   enter  continue   esc  stop setup
